 run:{before:'For a short easy run, a normal meal or a small banana is usually enough if hungry.',after:'Have a regular meal with carbohydrates and protein when convenient.',ideas:['Toast and eggs','Tuna sandwich + fruit','Rice bowl with chicken','Greek yogurt and granola (separate from meat meals)']},
